{"id":"db114ce2466afcde","group":"62","path":"62/62-df-bounded-Sigma1-CA.md","title":"Bounded Sigma-Zero-One Comprehension","display":"df-bounded-Sigma1-CA — Bounded Sigma-Zero-One Comprehension","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-df-bounded-Sigma1-CA","aliases":["62-df-bounded-Sigma1-CA"],"display":"df-bounded-Sigma1-CA — Bounded Sigma-Zero-One Comprehension","depends_on":["[[62-df-L2]]","[[62-df-ArithmeticHierarchy]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Definition II.3.8; Theorem II.3.9; Remark II.3.11","source_pages":[71,72],"source_pdf_pages":[89,90]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-df-bounded-Sigma1-CA"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-df-bounded-Sigma1-CA</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bounded-Sigma1-CA — Bounded Sigma-Zero-One Comprehension"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"eaea482f0ad24c81\" href=\"?note=eaea482f0ad24c81\" title=\"62-df-ArithmeticHierarchy\">62-df-ArithmeticHierarchy</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Definition II.3.8; Theorem II.3.9; Remark II.3.11"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>71</span><span>72</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89</span><span>90</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>UC 与自由变量见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^0_1(S_2)\">\\(\\Sigma^0_1(S_2)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"eaea482f0ad24c81\" href=\"?note=eaea482f0ad24c81\" title=\"62-df-ArithmeticHierarchy\">62-df-ArithmeticHierarchy</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 不在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 中自由出现，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span> 是不出现在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 中的新数变量。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{B}\\Sigma^0_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{CA}\">\\(\\mathrm{B}\\Sigma^0_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{CA}\\)</span> 在下式引入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}Sigma1\\text{-}CA}\\vdash\\;\\mathrm{B}\\Sigma^0_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{CA}(S_2)\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{UC}(\\forall b\\exists X\\forall i(i\\in X\\leftrightarrow(i&lt;b\\land\\varphi(i)))):\\varphi(i)\\in\\Sigma^0_1(S_2)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}Sigma1\\text{-}CA}\\vdash\\;\\mathrm{B}\\Sigma^0_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{CA}(S_2)\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{UC}(\\forall b\\exists X\\forall i(i\\in X\\leftrightarrow(i&lt;b\\land\\varphi(i)))):\\varphi(i)\\in\\Sigma^0_1(S_2)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>存在的是被一个数界截断的定义集；不蕴含无界 Σ⁰₁ 理解。这是“bounded comprehension”，与通常称为 BΣ₁ 的数值收集模式不同。数和集合参数允许出现并由 UC 关闭。RCA₀ 证明此模式；在保留 Δ⁰₁ 理解等基础公理时，它也能恢复 Σ⁰₁ 归纳。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Definition II.3.8; Theorem II.3.9; Remark II.3.11；纸面页 71, 72；PDF 页 89, 90。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-L2","status":"resolved","id":"4c6d2d9f1999915f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-L2]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-ArithmeticHierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"eaea482f0ad24c81","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-ArithmeticHierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-L2","status":"resolved","id":"4c6d2d9f1999915f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"UC 与自由变量见 [[62-df-L2]]，$\\Sigma^0_1(S_2)$ 见 [[62-df-ArithmeticHierarchy]]。$X$ 不在 $\\varphi$ 中自由出现，$b$ 是不出现在 $\\varphi$ 中的新数变量。$\\mathrm{B}\\Sigma^0_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{CA}$ 在下式引入。","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-ArithmeticHierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"eaea482f0ad24c81","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"UC 与自由变量见 [[62-df-L2]]，$\\Sigma^0_1(S_2)$ 见 [[62-df-ArithmeticHierarchy]]。$X$ 不在 $\\varphi$ 中自由出现，$b$ 是不出现在 $\\varphi$ 中的新数变量。$\\mathrm{B}\\Sigma^0_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{CA}$ 在下式引入。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma^0_1(S_2)","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"b","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{B}\\Sigma^0_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{CA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}Sigma1\\text{-}CA}\\vdash\\;\\mathrm{B}\\Sigma^0_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{CA}(S_2)\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{UC}(\\forall b\\exists X\\forall i(i\\in X\\leftrightarrow(i<b\\land\\varphi(i)))):\\varphi(i)\\in\\Sigma^0_1(S_2)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1522,"backlinks":[{"id":"c68a6ecbed6addff","anchor":"ref-24","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[62-df-bounded-Sigma1-CA|Bounded Sigma-Zero-One Comprehension]]"},{"id":"daf4a7fbfe8d8a48","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"理论与基础公理见 [[62-df-RCA0]]、[[62-df-basic-axioms]]、[[62-df-set-induction]]；$\\Delta^0_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{CA}$、$\\mathrm{B}\\Sigma^0_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{CA}$ 见 [[62-df-Delta1-CA]]、[[62-df-bounded-Sigma1-CA]]；$\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}$ 见 [[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]。$B=\\mathrm Q_2\\cup\\{\\mathrm I_{\\mathrm{set}}\\}\\cup\\Delta^0_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{CA}(S_2)$。"}],"outgoing":["4c6d2d9f1999915f","eaea482f0ad24c81"]}